WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Corrected training: real STL render, Hebrew narration, and NDIP-1226 Figure 2 surface mapping.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The STL provides geometry. E, A, B, C and D come from the approved procedure and ScanMaster plan.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Open the ScanMaster workflow, load Stage 1, and verify P/N 2A5001 with NDIP-1226 Rev F.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Before scanning: FBH #1, 80 percent FSH, water path, angle, DAC or TCG, then Scan.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Anatomy: E upper web transition, A upper chamfer, B upper land, C bore entry chamfer, D bore ID.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Each surface is scanned in +45 and -45. After each rotation, index by no more than 0.020 inch.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:44.000
Review C-scan, TOF, noise/dropout, post-calibration and traceability before saving.
